# Murph
tags: heroes, benchmark, memorial-day
stimulus: Long, brutal chipper under a vest; pacing and skin on the hands decide the day.
vest: 20/14 lb
note: Partition the pull-ups, push-ups and air squats as needed (a common scheme is 20 rounds of 5-10-15). Both runs are done unbroken, first and last.
For time
Buy-in: 1 mi Run
100 Pull-up
200 Push-up
300 Air squat
Cash-out: 1 mi Run

Scaled:
  Pull-up -> Ring row
  Push-up -> Knee push-up
